KerBridge -- third-party notices
================================

The KerBridge programs are statically linked. Every crate compiled into them is
listed below with its licence and that licence's full text, because MIT, BSD and
Apache-2.0 each require their notice to travel with a binary copy.

KerBridge's own crates appear here too, under their own terms. The
authoritative statement of those is /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright, which
is the file Debian Policy scopes to a package's own contents; this file is the
complete list of what is linked in, and makes no exception for the crates that
came from this repository.

This file is generated from Cargo.lock by cargo-about. Do not edit it.

